.TH ADGUARD-TRAY 1 "September 2026" "adguard-tray 1.10.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
adguard-tray \- system tray monitor and controller for adguard-cli
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B adguard-tray
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows AdGuard status in the system tray, starts and stops adguard-cli,
and manages filters, userscripts, HTTPS certificates and activity
statistics.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-check-update
Check whether a newer release exists and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-update
Print the command used to install a newer release (apt, or
.B git pull
from a source checkout) and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/adguard-tray/config.json
Application settings.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/adguard-tray/adguard-tray.log
Rotating log file.
.SH SEE ALSO
Homepage: https://github.com/RiDDiX/adguard-tray
